<title>UK: Avocet Mining pretax losses rises.</title>
<headline>Avocet Mining pretax losses rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avocet Mining, the largest tungsten producer in the western world, said on Wednesday that its pre-tax losses for the six months ended September 30 had risen to three million stg from 0.1 million.</p>
<p>The company, which has mines and operations in Peru, the United States and Portugal, said its turnover fell to 8.7 million stg from 11.0 in the previous year.</p>
<p>Its net assets as on September 30 stood at around 23.8 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +0171-542 7717</p>
